flowchart LR

    USER[Schwab User]

    SSO[SAML SSO]

    XAPI[Cloud Journey API]

    AUTH[APM Authorization Service]

    AGENT[Agent Runtime]

    GW[Agent Gateway]

    MCP[MCP Server]

    EXT[External Systems]


    USER --> SSO

    SSO --> XAPI

    XAPI --> AUTH

    AUTH --> AGENT

    AGENT --> GW

    GW --> MCP

    MCP --> EXT